        },
        {
          "type": "rich_paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "article",
              "text": "深偽（Deepfake）是什麼：分清合成痕跡、來源與事件真假",
              "kind": "life",
              "slug": "ai-term-deepfake"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "rich_paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "article",
              "text": "開放權重（Open Weights）：能下載模型，還要確認什麼",
              "kind": "life",
              "slug": "ai-term-open-weights"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "rich_paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "article",
              "text": "開源 AI（Open Source AI）：公開哪些東西才算完整",
